# S3 fixture ("created as Excel shows it"): conditional formatting through s3-data's New Rule (its
# script op on the selection: Excel's rule kinds, its galleries by number, its preset formats by
# number: 0 light red fill with dark red text, 1 yellow fill with dark yellow text, 2 green fill with
# dark green text, 3 light red fill, 4 red text, 5 bold). Cell value comparisons, text, duplicates,
# dates, top and above average, a formula, data bars, a color scale and icons; values typed in the
# en-NL region.
sheet-name "Rules"
enter A1 "Name"
enter B1 "Score"
enter C1 "Team"
enter D1 "Due"
enter E1 "Sales"
enter F1 "Growth"
enter G1 "Hours"
enter A2 "Ann"
enter A3 "Bob"
enter A4 "Cy"
enter A5 "Ann"
enter A6 "Dee"
enter A7 "Bob"
enter B2 "45"
enter B3 "92"
enter B4 "8"
enter B5 "55"
enter B6 "71"
enter B7 "30"
enter C2 "North"
enter C3 "South"
enter C4 "North-East"
enter C5 "West"
enter C6 "Southwest"
enter C7 "East"
enter D2 "2-1-2026"
enter D3 "15-3-2026"
enter D4 "30-6-2026"
enter D5 "1-9-2026"
enter D6 "24-12-2026"
enter D7 "31-12-2026"
enter E2 "120"
enter E3 "340"
enter E4 "95"
enter E5 "410"
enter E6 "60"
enter E7 "260"
enter F2 "5"
enter F3 "-2"
enter F4 "12"
enter F5 "7"
enter F6 "0"
enter F7 "3"
enter G2 "38"
enter G3 "40"
enter G4 "36"
enter G5 "45"
enter G6 "41"
enter G7 "39"
rule B2:B7 between "40" "60" format=1
rule B2:B7 icons choice=7
rule E2:E7 greater "200" format=2
rule E2:E7 bar choice=1
rule C2:C7 contains "North" format=0
rule A2:A7 duplicate format=3
rule A2:A7 formula "=$B2>90" format=5
rule D2:D7 date choice=3 format=0
rule F2:F7 scale choice=0
rule F2:F7 top "2" format=4
rule G2:G7 above format=2
save
expect rule Rules!B2:B7 type 1 operator 1
expect rule Rules!B2:B7 formula =40
expect rule Rules!B2:B7 formula2 =60
expect rule Rules!B2:B7 fill FFEB9C
expect rule Rules!B2:B7 font 9C5700
expect rule Rules!B2:B7 icons 4
expect rule Rules!E2:E7 type 1 operator 5
expect rule Rules!E2:E7 formula =200
expect rule Rules!E2:E7 fill C6EFCE
expect rule Rules!E2:E7 font 006100
expect rule Rules!E2:E7 bar 63C384
expect rule Rules!C2:C7 text 0 North
expect rule Rules!C2:C7 fill FFC7CE
expect rule Rules!C2:C7 font 9C0006
expect rule Rules!A2:A7 unique 1
expect rule Rules!A2:A7 fill FFC7CE
expect rule Rules!A2:A7 formula =$B2>90
expect rule Rules!D2:D7 period 2
expect rule Rules!F2:F7 scale 3
expect rule Rules!F2:F7 top 1 rank 2 percent False
expect rule Rules!F2:F7 font 9C0006
expect rule Rules!G2:G7 average 0
expect rule Rules!G2:G7 fill C6EFCE
